&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Three files exist for each model: one that is just the figure, one that is just the base, and one where the figure and base have been joined. I personally find printing the base and figure separately and gluing them together is the best for support addition/removal, but that&amp;#39;s just me!
